{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51430","headline":"桐柏观 · 郑薰","name":"桐柏观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深山桐柏观，残雪路犹分。\n数里踏红叶，全家穿但是云。\n月寒岩障晓，风远蕙兰芬。\n明日出云去，吹笙不可闻。\n（《古今图书集成·山川典》一二六《桐柏山部》（见《嘉定赤城志》卷三十。\n《天台前集》卷中题作《冬暮挈家宿桐拍观》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑薰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51430.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51430","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}